WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.335 --> 00:00:07.787
Tiles are sized by market value and coloured by the change you choose.

2
00:00:07.837 --> 00:00:11.842
Switch the colour to one month to see the trend instead of today.

3
00:00:11.892 --> 00:00:15.847
Select a region header to drill down a level.

4
00:00:15.897 --> 00:00:19.483
Then a country, then a sector.

5
00:00:19.533 --> 00:00:24.229
Select a tile for a quick view with price, returns and actions.

6
00:00:24.279 --> 00:00:28.118
The breadcrumb takes you back to the global view.
